# s3-pv-backend   20Gi   RWX   Retain   Released   dev1/cvat-test1-backend-data

# | Field                          | Meaning                                                        |
# | ------------------------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------- |
# | `Released`                     | PVC was deleted, **but PV still remembers it**                 |
# | `Retain`                       | Kubernetes will **NOT recycle or rebind** the PV automatically |
# | `dev1/cvat-test1-backend-data` | Old claimRef still exists internally                           |


